==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*20 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~4.67 seconds<sup>100f~140f</sup>.
*1 [[Moe Uzumasa & Doge]] spawns as the boss after 41.33 seconds<sup>1,240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that is able to be rushed if quick enough, using [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] or any other fast attackers can beat the stage easily so you don't have to face Moe Uzumasa & Doge. If you don't think that you will be quick enough then don't fret, even your team of [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] can beat the stage since everything has low HP.

